## Validation Checklist

* Heading levels are sequential: `h2` for sections, `h3` only under the current `h2`.
* No block nodes inside `PARAGRAPH` or `HEADING`.
* `LIST` contains only `LIST_ITEM`; each `LIST_ITEM` contains only `TEXT` nodes.
* No nested lists inside `LIST_ITEM`.
* `IMAGE.src` is present; `altText` is meaningful.
* No empty `children`; no empty `text`. `TEXT.format` may be `null`.
* `LINK.children` are `TEXT` nodes only.
* Adjacent `TEXT` nodes with the same `format` are merged, and required boundary spaces are preserved.

